A sized decorator layer marked repeat tiles its paint box from its placed position in both directions (CSS
background-repeat: repeat); the paint area's clip mask cuts the edge tiles, as a rounded box's does. Each tile is one
generation of the layer at the tile's box, so gradient coordinates are the tile's. Mask layers and more than 4096
tiles refuse.

